[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12365.429, "timestamp": "03:26:05", "text": "所以，它让你上瘾了吗？他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12367.67, "timestamp": "03:26:07", "text": "现在所有钥匙都在了。我觉得我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12370.229, "timestamp": "03:26:10", "text": "所有门都已解锁。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12373.19, "timestamp": "03:26:13", "text": "所以如果山羊是……的话，毛发就会消失。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12375.429, "timestamp": "03:26:15", "text": "吃那个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12377.03, "timestamp": "03:26:17", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12380.07, "timestamp": "03:26:20", "text": "如何才能长出更多头发？呃，我们找到了他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12384.79, "timestamp": "03:26:24", "text": "外部。是的。它会重生吗？是的。它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12387.03, "timestamp": "03:26:27", "text": "重生。哦，你能拿走这个吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12388.71, "timestamp": "03:26:28", "text": "汽油？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12390.95, "timestamp": "03:26:30", "text": "哦，你在哪里？在这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12394.389, "timestamp": "03:26:34", "text": "房间。糟糕。在后面。在后面。哦，在后面。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12397.349, "timestamp": "03:26:37", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12401.19, "timestamp": "03:26:41", "text": "这个。好的。还有你的电池"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12409.99, "timestamp": "03:26:49", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12411.75, "timestamp": "03:26:51", "text": "是的，我有一块金子。每个人都这样做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12414.07, "timestamp": "03:26:54", "text": "你养山羊吗？因为我觉得，哦，我觉得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12416.309, "timestamp": "03:26:56", "text": "我们准备就绪。哦，我不小心"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12419.67, "timestamp": "03:26:59", "text": "我的天哪。哦，没关系。是，是"}]